ds (targeting the 3–9+ active ad range) and inspect their active creatives, offers, and destination URLs.Step 2: Website, Form & Technical AuditWebsite & Form Check: Confirm the website loads properly and has working inquiry forms, booking/landing forms, or lead capture pages where ad traffic is sent.Meta Pixel Helper Pro: Check pixel installation, event firing, and tracking health to spot missing events or misconfigurations.PageSpeed (pagespeed.web.dev): Test mobile and desktop performance to identify slow load times, heavy assets, or layout shifts hurting ad conversion rates and ROAS.Step 3: Decision-Maker Sourcing (Hunter & LinkedIn)Find founders, owners, managing partners, marketing leads, or decision-makers using Hunter (managing credit limits carefully and supplementing with backup lookups/verification) and LinkedIn.Verify contact details and role relevance before adding prospects to outreach sequences.Step 4: Multi-Channel Outreach (Cold Email & LinkedIn DMs)Reach out via personalized Cold Email and LinkedIn DMs referencing their active Meta ads, landing page/form setup, and specific growth/speed/tracking/SEO opportunities.Follow up consistently across email, LinkedIn, calls, and WhatsApp where applicable.Step 5: Qualification, Appointment Setting & CRM HandoverQualify interested replies based on interest, needs, budget, and timeline.Book calls/appointments and log every lead, audit note, status, and follow-up date in HubSpot, Zoho CRM, LeadSquared, or Google Sheets before handing off to the closing team.   5. Lead Tracking Table TemplateBrand NameCountry (USA/UK/UAE)NicheActive Meta Ads (Count/Notes)Website & Form StatusPixel / Speed Audit NotesDecision Maker & RoleEmail / LinkedIn URLOutreach Status & Next Follow-UpExample BrandUSAFashion Boutique6 active adsActive landing page + inquiry formPixel active; mobile speed needs optimizationJane Doe (Founder)jane@example.com / LinkedInSent Email + DM; Follow up in 2 days6. Cold Email & LinkedIn DM TemplatesCold 